Transform extracted context.

Usage:
  strap context quote < context.json
  strap context render < context.json
  strap context summarize "only architectural decisions and unresolved risks" --model current --agent chat-concise --skill concise < context.json
  strap context summarize "dry run" --dry-run < context.json

`quote` marks extracted conversation as evidence, not active dialogue history.
`summarize` uses `strap one-shot` internally and outputs `strap.context-summary.v0.1`.
